          <attvalue for="35" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Acute semiconductor and memory shortages delay repairs, retrofits and new-build outfitting of commercial vessels and port systems, producing equipment failures, port congestion and cancelled sailings that reduce transit volumes through chokepoints." />
