          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A sustained tightening of monetary policy increases trade-finance and working-capital costs for traders and carriers, leading to inventory destocking, fewer bookings and deferred sailings that lower transit volumes through chokepoints." />
