          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A tighter monetary policy stance reduces bank lending and working‑capital lines for manufacturers and their suppliers, slowing fab ramp‑ups and inventory replenishment and thereby increasing near‑term chip and memory supply pressures." />
